OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome brightness along the east
OL,6,Fcoast this morning. Otherwise mainly
OL,7,Fdry this morning before outbreaks of
OL,8,Frain spread southeast this afternoon,
OL,9,Fperhaps turning heavy in the south
OL,10,Flater.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThis evening will be cloudy
OL,13,Fwith a few outbreaks of rain. Then the
OL,14,Frest of the night will be cloudy with
OL,15,Foccasional rain but some drier spells
OL,16,Ftoo.
OL,17,
OL,18,CWednesday:FA cloudy day with spells of
OL,19,Frain although becoming generally drier
OL,20,Fduring the afternoon. Chance of
OL,21,Ffurther rain in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
