OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,6,Fand bright for most of Thursday but
OL,7,Frain likely by evening. Overnight rain
OL,8,Fon Friday soon clearing then mainly
OL,9,Fdry and bright. Dry and bright on
OL,10,FSaturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
